* Matter Compiler v1 mapping: G=0.001 quant=10% range=unconstrained
* Frozen model weights were not changed.
* Physical AI - Experiment 6: compiled trained XOR network
* Source: models/xor_model.npz  (frozen; this file does not retrain)
* Hidden: precision ReLU. Output: linear.
* Signed weights: G+/G- paths, I_diff = I+ - I- by KCL in SPICE.
* Bias: 1 V reference through G_SCALE*|b| onto the + or - path.
* G_SCALE = 0.001

Vin1 in1 0 DC 0
Vin2 in2 0 DC 0
